Package: rtl8189fs-dkms
Version: 1.0.3
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms (>= 2.1.0.0), build-essential
Maintainer: Van der Decken <elsangithub@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Realtek RTL8189FS SDIO Wi-Fi Linux DKMS Driver
 Production-grade, turnkey out-of-tree DKMS driver for Realtek RTL8189FS
 (SDIO) Wi-Fi chipsets on ARM64 Linux kernels. Optimized for FiberHome HG680-P
 and TV Box architectures with throughput and IRQ tuning.
